  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Directly loading media from servers or streaming endpoints is currently delayed by nearly 2 whole seconds due to everything being piped through yt-dlp regardless of whether it needs it or not. This causes unwanted delays when trying to use externally stored audio or video for various world interaction content (this is also why video content loading on Quest was so much faster before it gained the ability to use (or was forced to use) yt-dlp).\n\nPlease provide a way for video players at the world level to bypass the yt-dlp lookup and just pass the URL directly to the respective video engine.",
